{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07682","headline":"还山贻湛法师 · 孟浩然","name":"还山贻湛法师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幼闻无生理，常欲观此身。\n心迹罕兼遂，[崎岖]多在尘。\n晚途归旧壑，偶与支公邻。\n导以微妙法，结爲清净因。\n烦恼业顿舍，山林情转殷。\n朝来问疑义，夕话得清真。\n墨妙称古绝，词华惊世人。\n禅房闭虚静，花药连冬春。\n平石籍琴砚，落泉洒衣巾。\n欲知冥灭意，朝夕海鸥驯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}